  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_5837.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado han finalizado las jornadas de toros en las fiestas del barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n, en Onda, que acabar&aacute;n este domingo por la noche con el desfile final. Antes, a la hora de la comida, hay paella monumental.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5650.jpg\" alt=\"img_5650\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5651.jpg\" alt=\"img_5651\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5652.jpg\" alt=\"img_5652\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5653.jpg\" alt=\"img_5653\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5654.jpg\" alt=\"img_5654\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5655.jpg\" alt=\"img_5655\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5656.jpg\" alt=\"img_5656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5657.jpg\" alt=\"img_5657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabteboussantjoaquim13/img_5658.jpg\" alt=\"img_5658\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://